extends RefCounted
## Declared inputs of the bake producers that use a narrow key
## (current523_bake_cache.gd producer_key()). "roots" and "ignore" are
## written by hand; "files" is GENERATED by
## tools/current523_bake_producers_update.gd (the transitive closure of the
## roots, current523_bake_dependencies.gd) and checked by
## tests/current523_bake_producer_key_test.gd. Where sources are readable the
## runtime re-scans and refuses a stale list (global key instead).
##
## "ignore" lists inputs whose identity is already a key part (never code).
##
## Not declared here, on the global key on purpose: monsterbook523,
## source523_shop_catalog and the native item templates
## (current523_native_item_projection.gd) reach ~850 files including the
## world/UI scripts and many run-time built load() paths, so a static closure
## is not a reliable input list for them.
